[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0010","text":"────────鬼出去，福进来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_1000","text":"女中学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0020","text":"────你那边那个补习班，现在教到哪了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0030","text":"嗯——课本内容已经全部上完了……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0040","text":"喂，福丸同学……今天有空吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0050","text":"────……诶……那个…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0060","text":"其实啊，我想组织大家一起开个学习会"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0070","text":"……！　啊………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0080","text":"你要是没事的话，想让你帮我顶一下打扫值日……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0090","text":"真是帮大忙了\n谢谢你，福丸同学────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32200300_02_0100","text":"────────鬼是…………，福是…………"}]
